    "<ab(400)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>今、あたいたちだけで乗り込んだって、\n分が悪いからね。<ab(400)>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>Charging in by ourselves right now\nis bad odds, after all.<ab(400)>",
   "notes": "Min using 'あたいたち' to refer to herself and Meio."
  },
  {
