   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<op()><sp(20)>お前はそれでいいのか！？　\nドラグナーが憎くはないのか！？<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "en": "<op()><sp(20)>Are you fine with that?!\nDon't you hate the Dragonar?!<ab(300)><ed()>",
   "notes": "Meio asking Min, remembering her squad's grudge against Dragonar."
